  "bodyHtml": "<article class=\"content-panel studio-page\">\n                    <section class=\"studio-intro studio-section\">\n                        <div class=\"studio-copy\">\n                            <p class=\"eyebrow\">Case study</p>\n                            <h2>Mission context</h2>\n                            <p>As part of its digital transformation, Bruxelles Environnement wanted to make\n                                its showcase website more sustainable, integrating digital sobriety from the\n                                redesign phase.</p>\n                            <p>The project follows a lifecycle logic (manufacturing, use, end of life) and\n                                the regional Responsible Digital dynamic led with Paradigm.</p>\n                            <p>The ecodesign approach was formalised from the specification:\n                                methodology, objectives, best practice annexes and hosting-related\n                                criteria.</p>\n                            <p><strong>Client:</strong> Bruxelles Environnement<br><strong>Completion date:</strong>\n                                23/12/2022</p>\n                        </div>\n                        <figure class=\"studio-figure\">\n                            <img src=\"../../../assets/img/external/greenspector.com/bruxelles-environnement-1024x472_3a3d8e7b.jpeg\" alt=\"Bruxelles Environnement - eco-responsible website redesign\">\n                        </figure>\n                    </section>\n\n                    <section class=\"studio-section\">\n                        <figure class=\"studio-figure\">\n                            <img src=\"../../../assets/img/external/greenspector.com/mockupBruxellesEnvironnement_f8ea2e99.jpg\" alt=\"Bruxelles Environnement website mockup\">\n                        </figure>\n                        <ul>\n                            <li>Ecodesign integrated into methodology and project approach.</li>\n                            <li>Digital sobriety objectives included in redesign requirements.</li>\n                            <li>Best practice annexes and recommended audit tools.</li>\n                            <li>Requirements for a hosting solution consistent with the environmental strategy.</li>\n                        </ul>\n                    </section>\n\n                    <section class=\"studio-section\">\n                        <p class=\"eyebrow\">Before / after measurements</p>\n                        <h2>Objectify progress</h2>\n                        <div class=\"studio-grid\">\n                            <figure class=\"studio-figure\">\n                                <img src=\"../../../assets/img/external/greenspector.com/Metric-radial-ecoscore_602a2fef.png\" alt=\"Greenspector ecoscore before redesign\">\n                            </figure>\n                            <figure class=\"studio-figure\">\n                                <img src=\"../../../assets/img/external/greenspector.com/ecoscore_0001_co2_043462ca.png\" alt=\"Carbon impact before redesign\">\n                            </figure>\n                            <figure class=\"studio-figure\">\n                                <img src=\"../../../assets/img/external/greenspector.com/green_1a5301ce.png\" alt=\"Greenspector ecoscore after redesign\">\n                            </figure>\n                            <figure class=\"studio-figure\">\n                                <img src=\"../../../assets/img/external/greenspector.com/ecoscore_0000_new-co2_4b38f200.png\" alt=\"Carbon impact after redesign\">\n                            </figure>\n                        </div>\n                    </section>\n\n                    <section class=\"studio-section studio-quote-section\">\n                        <p class=\"eyebrow\">Interview</p>\n                        <h2>Project team feedback</h2>\n                        <blockquote class=\"studio-quote\">\n                            <p>\"We requested an audit of graphic mockups before development to adjust\n                                the most impactful choices. We wanted to act early, without compromising\n                                user experience.\"</p>\n                            <footer>\n                                <img src=\"../../../assets/img/external/greenspector.com/caroline-smeyers-300x-crop-1_14194843.jpg\" alt=\"Portrait of Caroline Smeyers\">\n                                <div>\n                                    <strong>Caroline Smeyers</strong>\n                                    <span>Web Manager, Bruxelles Environnement</span>\n                                </div>\n                            </footer>\n                        </blockquote>\n                    </section>\n\n                    <section class=\"studio-section\">\n                        <p class=\"eyebrow\">Implementation</p>\n                        <h2>How efficiency was maintained over time</h2>\n                        <p>After mockup audit, close support (2 days per 3-week sprint)\n                            helped prioritise key actions and guide the most efficient technical choices.</p>\n                        <p>An initial benchmark on 30 pages of the old site served as reference. Equivalent pages\n                            on the new site were then measured daily to drive\n                            corrections and verify objectives were met.</p>\n                        <p>The project shows that success depends on anticipation, clear governance of\n                            roles and continuous tracking involving all stakeholders.</p>\n                    </section>\n\n                    <section class=\"studio-section studio-highlight\">\n                        <div class=\"studio-copy\">\n                            <p class=\"eyebrow\">Operational advice</p>\n                            <h2>Key takeaways</h2>\n                            <ul>\n                                <li>Integrate ecodesign from ideation, not only at development.</li>\n                                <li>Train teams and clarify responsibilities before kick-off.</li>\n                                <li>Objectify results with an environmental budget and regular measurements.</li>\n                                <li>Accept schedule trade-offs to guarantee sustainable deliverable quality.</li>\n                            </ul>\n                            <p>Feedback highlights that expert support accelerates\n                                team learning while securing the project trajectory.</p>\n                        </div>\n                    </section>\n\n                    <section class=\"studio-section\">\n                        <p class=\"eyebrow\">Resources</p>\n                        <h2>Learn more</h2>\n                        <ul>\n                            <li><a href=\"https://greenspector.com/fr/methodologie-calcul-empreinte-environnementale/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Methodology de calcul de l'empreinte\n                                    environnementale</a></li>\n                            <li><a href=\"https://greenspector.com/fr/comment-est-calcule-lecoscore-dans-le-cas-dun-benchmark-web-ou-mobile/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">How ecoscore is calculated in a\n                                    web or mobile benchmark</a></li>\n                        </ul>\n                        <p><strong>Author:</strong> Thierry Leboucq</p>\n                    </section>\n                </article>"
}
